+## 0.4.0-alpha.4
+- Keeps the same persistent Chronyx signing identity so Android can update in place from 0.3.0-alpha.3.
+- Adds origin-scoped ChatGPT/OpenAI compatibility mode with third-party cookies on ChatGPT tabs, media/WebRTC-friendly playback, cookie flushing, and supported-browser login fallback.
+- Does not bypass authentication, SSL errors, Safe Browsing, or site anti-abuse controls.
